{"seq":11,"slug":"economic-anthropology","title":"经济人类学","stage":"DONE","category":"anthropology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 经济人类学\n\n把一笔交易拆开看，里面装的从来不只是价格。一头猪在新几内亚高地换来的是结盟与声望，一张钞票在不同人手里被花成完全不同的东西，一笔债务能把人绑成一辈子的人情，也能让一个国家俯首。经济人类学研究的就是这件事：经济不是一台脱离社会的计算机器，而是深深嵌在亲属、宗教、政治、道德与意义之中的人类活动。它不假设「理性经济人」放之四海皆准，而是去田野里看真实的人如何生产、交换、消费与积累，再回头追问那些被当作普世规律的经济学命题，究竟有多少是西方资本主义社会的特例。\n\n这个 hub 沿四条主线层层递进。第一条是「基础与理论之争」：从形式论与实在论那场决定学科性格的辩论出发，经由波兰尼的嵌入性与互惠、再分配、市场交换三种整合形式，落到莫斯《礼物》揭示的「给予—接受—回报」义务链——这三篇奠定了「经济是社会关系」这一核心立场。第二条是「交换与价值」：货币如何被文化标记和区隔、市场背后藏着怎样的道德契约、消费与物质如何成为身份与意义的载体——价值在这里被还原为社会建构而非自然给定。第三条是「生产与生计」：不同社会用什么生产方式维生、正式之外庞大的非正式经济如何运转、家户作为最古老的经济单位有何内在逻辑——视线从交换转向劳动与维生。第四条是「当代议题」：把人类学的镜头对准资本主义本身、对准格雷伯笔下五千年的债务史、对准 2026 年正在重塑货币的加密资产——经典工具在此面对全新的对象。\n\n四条主线不是并列的清单，而是一个由内向外的同心圆：理论之争确立了看问题的姿态，交换与价值给出了分析的对象，生产与生计补上了维生的另一半，当代议题则把整套视角投回我们自己身处的世界。读完会发现，所谓「经济」始终是关于人如何彼此亏欠、彼此联结的故事。\n\n建议从 [基础与理论之争](1_foundations-debates/_INTRODUCTION.md) 读起，它是理解后续一切的钥匙；急于看当下的读者也可以直接跳到 [当代议题](4_contemporary/_INTRODUCTION.md)，再回头补理论。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations-debates","title":"基础与理论之争","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/foundations-debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"formalism-substantivism-debate","title":"形式论与实在论之争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/foundations-debates/formalism-substantivism-debate"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reciprocity-redistribution-polanyi","title":"互惠、再分配与波兰尼的嵌入性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/foundations-debates/reciprocity-redistribution-polanyi"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gift-economy-mauss","title":"礼物经济与莫斯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/foundations-debates/gift-economy-mauss"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"exchange-value","title":"交换与价值","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/exchange-value","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"money-and-value-culture","title":"货币与价值的文化建构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/exchange-value/money-and-value-culture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"markets-and-moral-economy","title":"市场与道德经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/exchange-value/markets-and-moral-economy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consumption-material-culture","title":"消费与物质文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/exchange-value/consumption-material-culture"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"production-livelihood","title":"生产与生计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/production-livelihood","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modes-of-production-livelihood","title":"生产方式与生计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/production-livelihood/modes-of-production-livelihood"},{"seq":2,"slug":"labor-informal-economy","title":"劳动与非正式经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/production-livelihood/labor-informal-economy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"household-economy","title":"家户经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/production-livelihood/household-economy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary","title":"当代议题","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/contemporary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anthropology-of-capitalism","title":"资本主义的人类学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/contemporary/anthropology-of-capitalism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"financialization-debt-graeber","title":"金融化与债务（格雷伯）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/contemporary/financialization-debt-graeber"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-economy-crypto","title":"数字经济与加密货币","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/economic-anthropology/contemporary/digital-economy-crypto"}]}]}